# ===================================================
# CREDENTIALS — NEVER COMMIT THESE
# ===================================================
# Google Service Account JSON files contain a private
# key that grants programmatic access to your Google
# Cloud project. If committed, anyone with repository
# access can impersonate your Service Account.
#
# All credential files must be injected at runtime
# via environment variables or Render Secret Files.
# ===================================================
credentials/
**/credentials/
**/service-account.json
**/google-credentials.json
*-credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pkcs12

.env
.env.local
.env.production

